Subject: [PATCH] Add backend: API routes, data layer, and
 newsletter/events/about pages

- lib/data.ts: typed static data for articles, issues, events, team
- POST /api/subscribe: email validation + in-memory subscriber store
- GET /api/articles: filterable article list with sidebar data
- GET /api/events: filterable upcoming events + past events
- /newsletter: server-rendered page with client SubscribeForm component
- /events: server-rendered page with client EventsFilter for type filtering
- /about: server-rendered team page
- SiteNav: shared nav component used across all three new pages

